  "title": "Star chromatic index of complete graphs",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Conjecture Is it possible to color edges of the complete graph $K_n$ using $O(n)$ colors, so that the coloring is proper and no 4-cycle and no 4-edge path is using only two colors?\n\nEquivalently: is the star chromatic index of $K_n$ linear in $n$?",
